{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Enforces FX chain order on all tracks every second:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Prioritize midi fx (Humanizer, Swing Thing, Reaticulate, ReaControlMIDI, MB Note Quantize, note_quantizer) FIRST, in any order amongst themselves\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab VST instruments directly after in order added\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab All other FX: after instruments, in their original order\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Trims the edges of selected MIDI items to the nearest barline and resolves slight overlaps or gaps between neighbouring items on the same track. Items are never split and never moved, so notes keep their exact positions.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
